            ? "Walk up to Deoxys and press Enter (or tap it) to challenge the Mythical Pokémon to Mancala. Step on the mat to leave."
            : currentPlace === 'reception'
            ? "Welcome to the Pokémon Center Front Desk! Nurse Mira is here to help you navigate Zulfan's portfolio, heal your team, and refill your Poké Balls. Use the PC terminal to access the network. Step on the door mat to exit."
            : currentPlace === 'mart'
            ? "Welcome to Zulfan's Poké Mart! Browse software engineering services, inspect tech stack TMs, grab developer potions, or pick up Zulfan's official CV. Talk to Clerk Kevin to discuss a project. Step on the door mat to exit."
            : currentPlace === 'tower'
            ? "Welcome to Tech Tower HQ! Explore 4 floors of robotics, distributed cloud architecture, and industrial R&D. Talk to Xurkitree AI Host at the reception, inspect the ESP32 Robotics workshop, explore the NOC server racks, or take the executive elevator to switch floors. Step on the door mat to exit."
            : currentPlace === 'cafe'
            ? "Welcome to Poké-Café & Developer Roastery Bar! Order a custom Dev Blend from Master Barista Rio, greet Alcremie for a Castelia Cone boost, spin lo-fi vinyl records on the Jukebox, or book a 1-on-1 Coffee Chat at the VIP Booth. Step on the door mat to exit."
            : currentPlace === 'arena'
            ? "Ave, Challenger! Welcome to the Gladiator Colosseum. Choose your Gladiator from the Armory to duel Champion Mewtwo in the Sand Pit, conquer the Six Trials of Rome, or inspect the Hall of Victors. Step on the south gate mat to exit."
            : currentPlace === 'garden'
            ? "Welcome to the Botanical Berry Plantation & Sakura Conservatory! Greet Gardevoir and Celebi, irrigate the soil beds from the Sprayduck Well, plant and harvest 6 heirloom berry strains, or spin the Copper Berry Blender. Step on the south garden gate to exit."
            : currentPlace === 'neighbour'
            ? "Welcome to Neighbour Maya's Cozy Dev Cottage! Greet Maya and Eevee, sip hot Oolong tea by the crackling fireplace, play PR Review Ping-Pong on the retro CRT, or pin a sticky note on the Neighbour Guestbook. Step on the south mat to exit."
            : currentPlace === 'digimon'
            ? "Welcome to Digi-Sanctuary Island (40×45)! Explore Central Digi-Plaza, inspect the DigiDex Master Console, or visit the 4 Elemental Habitat Zones. Head West to (5, 22) for the Dark Castle Void Gate, South to (20, 40) for the Royal Kingdom, or North Return Gate to Town."
            : currentPlace === 'kingdom'
            ? "Welcome to the Royal Kingdom of Avalon (45×60)! Walk past the Grand Royal Castle via the twin flanking courtyards, explore all 7 landmarks, march south to (22, 59) to visit Harbour Town, or step onto the North Drawbridge to return to Digi-Sanctuary."
            : currentPlace === 'harbour'
            ? "Welcome to Harbour Town (45×60)! Climb the bluff stairs to the Old Port Lighthouse, explore the Customs Warehouse, rest at Harbourmaster Inn, stroll across the twin wooden piers beside the Royal Brigantine, or walk north to return to Royal Kingdom (22, 59)."
            : currentPlace === 'sky-castle'
            ? "Welcome to Sky Castle (45×60)! Cross floating bridges between the White Marble Citadel, Crystal Plaza, Twin Cloud Windmills, Golden Astral Observatory, and Radiant Sky Chapel. Walk south down the Grand Sky-Bridge to return to Digi-Sanctuary (36, 22)."
            : currentPlace === 'dark-castle'
            ? "Welcome to Dark Castle (45×64)! Cross the crystal light bridges above the molten chasm to explore the Shadow Cathedral, Crimson Reactor Forge, Obsidian Obelisk, Blood Manor, and Chained Chrono Vault. Step into the North Abyssal Vortex to return to Digi-Sanctuary at (5, 22)."
            : currentPlace === 'dark-cathedral'
            ? "Welcome to the Shadow Cathedral (15×12)! Step forward along the amethyst carpet to play the Echo Organ Simon-Says Memory Puzzle, talk to Prism Necrozma & Gardevoir, or read The Obsidian Grimoire of engineering war stories."
            : currentPlace === 'dark-forge'
            ? "Welcome to the Crimson Reactor Forge (15×12)! Adjust the 3 geothermal plasma sliders to stabilize the blazing Magma Core, consult Machinedramon, or strike the Tech Stack Anvil to forge system architectures."
            : currentPlace === 'dark-manor'
            ? "Welcome to Demon Keep & Blood Manor (15×12)! March along the crimson runner to challenge Darkrai in a 4-round tactical debugging duel, train with Urshifu, or tour the Gallery of Cursed Bugs."
            : currentPlace === 'dark-vault'
            ? "Welcome to the Chained Chrono Vault (15×12)! Synchronize the 4 interlocking clockwork gears to shatter the temporal chains, commune with Dialga, or open the Portfolio Epoch Time-Capsule."
            : "An interactive pixel-art town. Walk into buildings to explore projects, lab research, and dev logs. Inspect social runes or talk to the Digital Twin."}
        </p>
      </div>
      <button class="town-guide__close" type="button" aria-label="Hide room guide" data-town-guide-close="">×</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="visually-hidden" aria-live="polite" data-town-live="">{currentPlace === 'arcade' ? 'Arcade: Walk up to Deoxys and press Enter (or tap it) to play Mancala. Step on the mat to leave.' : ''}</div>

  <!-- Collapsible Handheld Touch Controller (Active on Touch / pointer: coarse) -->
  <div id="town-mobile-controls" class="town-mobile-controls" aria-label="Virtual Gamepad">
    <div class="town-mobile-controls__pad-row">
      <div class="town-dpad" role="group" aria-label="Directional pad">
        <button id="dpad-up" class="town-dpad-btn town-dpad-up" aria-label="Walk Up">▲</button>
        <button id="dpad-left" class="town-dpad-btn town-dpad-left" aria-label="Walk Left">◀</button>
        <div class="town-dpad-center" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <button id="dpad-right" class="town-dpad-btn town-dpad-right" aria-label="Walk Right">▶</button>
        <button id="dpad-down" class="town-dpad-btn town-dpad-down" aria-label="Walk Down">▼</button>
      </div>

      <button
        type="button"
        id="btn-touchpad-minimize"
        class="town-touchpad-toggle"
        aria-expanded="true"
        title="Minimize D-Pad (Gunakan Tap-to-Move)"
      >
        ▾ Tap-to-Move
      </button>

      <div class="town-action-cluster">
        <button id="btn-touch-move" type="button" class="town-action-btn town-action-btn--skill" aria-label="Signature Move" title="Signature Move (⚡)">
          <span class="town-action-btn__letter">⚡</span>
        </button>
        <button id="btn-touch-bike" type="button" class="town-action-btn town-action-btn--b" aria-label="Run / Ride" title="Mach Bike / Poké Ride (B)">
          <span class="town-action-btn__letter">B</span>
        </button>
        <button id="btn-interact" type="button" class="town-action-btn" aria-label="Action / Interact" title="Interact (A)">
          <span class="town-action-btn__letter">A</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <button
      type="button"
      id="btn-touchpad-restore"
      class="town-touchpad-restore"
      aria-label="Show Virtual D-Pad"
    >
      🎮 D-Pad
    </button>
  </div>

  {isWorldScenePlace && <TownEditorOverlay currentPlace={currentPlace} />}
  <!-- Toast Notification -->
  <div id="town-editor-toast" class="town-editor-toast hidden" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>

  <!-- Floating Poké Ride Active Control Pill -->
  <div
    id="town-pokeride-hud"
    class="hidden fixed bottom-16 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-30 items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-950/90 border border-amber-400/50 shadow-[0_6px_24px_rgba(245,158,11,0.28)] backdrop-blur-md text-xs font-mono text-white select-none transition-all duration-200"
    style="display: none;"
    role="region"
    aria-label="Kontrol Poké Ride Aktif"
  >
    <div id="pokeride-hud-header" class="flex items-center gap-1.5 shrink-0">
      <span id="pokeride-hud-icon" class="text-sm">🏇</span>
      <span id="pokeride-hud-name" class="font-bold text-amber-300 text-[11px] whitespace-nowrap">Poké Ride</span>
    </div>
    <div id="pokeride-hud-details" class="flex flex-col leading-tight pr-1">
      <span
        id="pokeride-hud-badge"
        class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider bg-amber-500/20 text-amber-200 border border-amber-400/40 w-fit whitespace-nowrap"
      >
        ⚡ Terra Charge
      </span>
      <span id="pokeride-hud-sub" class="text-[9px] text-slate-300 hidden sm:inline whitespace-nowrap">
        Kecepatan Tinggi Aktif
      </span>
    </div>
    <div id="pokeride-hud-actions" class="flex items-center gap-2 shrink-0">
      <button
        type="button"
        id="btn-pokeride-skill"
        class="px-2 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-500/20 hover:bg-cyan-500/35 text-cyan-200 border border-cyan-400/40 text-[10px] font-bold transition cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap"
        title="Gunakan Skill Visual Burst (Tekan X)"
      >
        ⚡ Skill (X)
      </button>
      <button
        type="button"
        id="btn-pokeride-dismount"
        class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-rose-500/25 hover:bg-rose-500/40 text-rose-200 border border-rose-400/40 text-[10px] font-bold transition cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap"
        title="Turun dari Pokémon / Digimon (Tekan R)"
      >
        👟 Turun (R)
      </button>
    </div>
    <button
      type="button"
      id="btn-pokeride-toggle"
      class="w-5 h-5 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 active:scale-90 text-[10px] text-slate-300 hover:text-white transition cursor-pointer border border-white/10 shrink-0"
      title="Minimalkan Kontrol (Minimize)"
      aria-label="Minimalkan atau maksimalkan kontrol Poké Ride"
    >
      🔽
    </button>
  </div>

  <!-- Floating Mini-Map Radar Widget with Integrated Zoom Controls -->
  <div id="town-editor-minimap" class="town-editor-minimap hidden" style="display: none;" role="region" aria-label="Radar Kota 2D">
    <div class="town-editor-minimap__header">
      <span class="town-editor-minimap__title" id="town-minimap-title">🧭 RADAR KOTA</span>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1">
        <button type="button" id="btn-minimap-toggle" class="town-editor-minimap__toggle" title="Minimalkan / Munculkan Radar">🔽</button>
        <button type="button" id="btn-minimap-close" class="town-editor-minimap__toggle hover:text-rose-400" title="Tutup Radar">✕</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="town-minimap-body" class="town-editor-minimap__body flex-col gap-1.5">
      <canvas id="town-minimap-canvas" width="90" height="128" class="town-minimap-canvas cursor-pointer" title="Klik untuk jalan • Shift+Klik untuk terbang"></canvas>
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between w-full gap-1 pt-0.5 border-t border-slate-700/70">
        <button type="button" id="btn-minimap-zoom-out" class="town-minimap-zoom-btn" title="Perkecil Zoom (-)">−</button>
        <button type="button" id="btn-minimap-zoom-reset" class="town-minimap-zoom-label" title="Reset Zoom 100%">100%</button>
        <button type="button" id="btn-minimap-zoom-in" class="town-minimap-zoom-btn" title="Perbesar Zoom (+)">+</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div id="town-minimap-hint" class="px-2 pb-1.5 text-[9px] font-mono text-cyan-200/70 text-center tracking-tight">
      Klik: Jalan • Shift: Terbang
    </div>
  </div>

  <noscript>
    <p class="town-noscript">The town needs JavaScript, but every page works without it. Use the menu above.</p>
  </noscript>
</section>

<script define:vars={{ townData, currentPlace }}>
  window.__TOWN_DATA__ = townData;
  window.__CURRENT_PLACE__ = currentPlace;
</script>

<script>
  import { TownEngine } from '../engine/TownEngine';
  import { sfx } from '../game/sfx';
  import { townConfig } from '../engine/townConfig';
  import { COMPANIONS_MAP } from '../engine/pokemonCompanions';
  import { gameStore } from '../game/store';
  import { getStoredActiveFollower } from '../game/storage';
  import { navigateWithMapTransition } from '../lib/mapTransition';
  import { initPokeSnapAndTourUi } from '../engine/ui/pokesnapAndTour';
  import {
    fetchGuestbookEntries,
    getLocalGuestbookEntries,
    GHOST_ENABLED_STORAGE_KEY,
    type GuestbookEntry,
  } from '../lib/socialClient';

  let engine: TownEngine | null = null;

  function initTown() {
    const canvas = document.getElementById('town-canvas') as HTMLCanvasElement;
    if (!canvas) return;

    const spawnPlace = (window as unknown as { __CURRENT_PLACE__: string }).__CURRENT_PLACE__ || 'town';
    townConfig.setActiveWorld(
      spawnPlace === 'digimon'
        ? 'digimon'
        : spawnPlace === 'kingdom'
          ? 'kingdom'
          : spawnPlace === 'harbour'
            ? 'harbour'
            : spawnPlace === 'sky-castle'
              ? 'sky-castle'
              : spawnPlace === 'dark-castle'
                ? 'dark-castle'
                : 'town'
    );
    townConfig.loadFromStorage();
    if (typeof sessionStorage !== 'undefined' && spawnPlace !== 'town') {
      sessionStorage.setItem('town:last_place', spawnPlace);
    }

    const bubble = document.querySelector('[data-town-bubble]') as HTMLDivElement | null;
    let bubbleActionLink: HTMLAnchorElement | HTMLButtonElement | null = null;

    const editorToast = document.getElementById('town-editor-toast');
    const showToast = (msg: string) => {
      if (!editorToast) return;
      editorToast.textContent = msg;
      editorToast.classList.remove('hidden');
      editorToast.classList.add('is-visible');
      window.setTimeout(() => {
        editorToast.classList.remove('is-visible');
        editorToast.classList.add('hidden');
      }, 3000);
    };

    window.addEventListener('town:editor-toast', ((e: CustomEvent<string>) => {
      if (e?.detail) showToast(e.detail);
    }) as EventListener);

    const showBubble = (
      title: string,
      text: string,
      action?:
        | { label: string; href?: string; onClick?: () => void }
        | { label: string; href?: string; onClick?: () => void }[]
    ) => {
      if (!bubble) return;
      bubble.innerHTML = '';
      bubbleActionLink = null;

      const strong = document.createElement('strong');
      strong.textContent = title;
      bubble.appendChild(strong);

      const span = document.createElement('span');
      span.textContent = text;
      bubble.appendChild(span);

      const actionsList = Array.isArray(action) ? action : action ? [action] : [];
      if (actionsList.length > 0) {
        const actionWrap = document.createElement('div');
        actionWrap.className = 'town-bubble__actions flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 mt-2';
        for (let idx = 0; idx < actionsList.length; idx++) {
          const act = actionsList[idx];
          if (act.href) {
            const a = document.createElement('a');
            a.className = 'town-bubble__action';
            a.href = act.href;
            a.target = act.href.startsWith('http') ? '_blank' : '_self';
            if (a.target === '_blank') a.rel = 'noopener noreferrer';
            a.textContent = `${act.label} ➜`;
            actionWrap.appendChild(a);
            if (idx === 0) bubbleActionLink = a;
          } else if (act.onClick) {
            const btn = document.createElement('button');
            btn.type = 'button';
            btn.className = 'town-bubble__action';
            btn.textContent = `${act.label} ➜`;
            btn.onclick = () => {
              hideBubble();
              act.onClick?.();
            };
            actionWrap.appendChild(btn);
            if (idx === 0) bubbleActionLink = btn;
          }
        }
        bubble.appendChild(actionWrap);
      }

      const hint = document.createElement('span');
      hint.className = 'town-bubble__hint';
      hint.innerHTML = 'Press <kbd>Enter</kbd> to open';
      bubble.appendChild(hint);

      const closeBtn = document.createElement('button');
      closeBtn.type = 'button';
      closeBtn.className = 'town-bubble__close';
      closeBtn.setAttribute('aria-label', 'Close message');
      closeBtn.textContent = '×';
      closeBtn.onclick = hideBubble;
      bubble.appendChild(closeBtn);

      bubble.removeAttribute('hidden');
      sfx.select();
    };

    const hideBubble = () => {
      if (bubble) bubble.setAttribute('hidden', '');
      bubbleActionLink = null;
    };

    // Keyboard handlers for bubble
    window.addEventListener(
      'keydown',
      (e) => {
        if (!bubble || bubble.hasAttribute('hidden')) return;

        if (e.key === 'Escape') {
          e.preventDefault();
          hideBubble();
          canvas.focus();
        } else if (e.key === 'Enter' && bubbleActionLink) {
          e.preventDefault();
          bubbleActionLink.click();
          hideBubble();
        }
      },
      { capture: true }
    );

    // Initialize TownEngine
    const townData = (window as unknown as { __TOWN_DATA__: any }).__TOWN_DATA__;

    engine = new TownEngine(canvas, townData, spawnPlace, {
      onDialogue: (name, lines) => {
        showBubble(name, lines.join(' '));
      },
      onBubble: showBubble,
      onNavigate: (route) => {
        if (route === '/town' || route === 'town') route = '/';
        if ((route === '/' || route.startsWith('/?from=digimon')) && spawnPlace !== 'town' && typeof sessionStorage !== 'undefined') {
          if (!sessionStorage.getItem('town:respawn')) {
            sessionStorage.setItem('town:respawn', townConfig.getExitRespawnForPlace(spawnPlace));
          }
        }
        if (route === '/dev') gameStore.addStamp('dev');
        if (route === '/twin') gameStore.addStamp('twin');
        if (route === '/arcade') gameStore.addStamp('arcade');
        navigateWithMapTransition(route);
      },
      onEncounter: () => {
        document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('town:wild-encounter'));
      },
      onRefill: () => {
        document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('town:refill-balls'));
      },
      onOpenModal: (target) => {
        document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('town:open-modal', { detail: { target } }));
      },
    });

    const townSection = document.querySelector('.town') as HTMLElement | null;
    if (townSection && window.ResizeObserver) {
      new ResizeObserver(() => {
        engine?.handleResize();
      }).observe(townSection);
    }
    const labelButtons = document.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('.town-label');
    labelButtons.forEach((btn) => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const id = btn.getAttribute('data-id');
        if (id && engine) {
          hideBubble();
          engine.walkToObject(id);
          if (id === 'kiosk') {
            engine.interactFacing('kiosk');
          } else if (id === 'arena') {
            engine.interactFacing('arena');
          } else if (id === 'berry' || id === 'garden') {
            engine.interactFacing('berry');
          } else if (id === 'villa' || id === 'neighbour') {
            engine.interactFacing('neighbour');
          }
          canvas.focus();
        }
      });
    });

    // Floor Chip Click Listener (toggle 1F <-> 2F)
    const floorChip = document.querySelector('[data-floor-chip]') as HTMLElement | null;
    if (floorChip) {
      floorChip.style.cursor = 'pointer';
      floorChip.title = 'Click to switch floor (1F / 2F)';
      floorChip.addEventListener('click', () => {
        if (engine) {
          hideBubble();
          const next = engine.getHomeFloor() === '1F' ? '2F' : '1F';
          engine.switchHomeFloor(next);
        }
      });
    }

    // Town Room Guide
    const guide = document.querySelector('[data-town-guide]') as HTMLElement | null;
    const guideToggle = document.querySelector('[data-town-guide-toggle]') as HTMLButtonElement | null;
    const guideCard = document.getElementById('town-guide-card');
    const guideClose = document.querySelector('[data-town-guide-close]');

    if (guide && guideToggle && guideCard) {
      guide.removeAttribute('hidden');

      guideToggle.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const expanded = guideToggle.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
        if (expanded) {
          guideToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
          guideCard.setAttribute('hidden', '');
        } else {
          guideToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'true');
          guideCard.removeAttribute('hidden');
          sfx.select();
        }
      });

      guideClose?.addEventListener('click', () => {
        guideToggle.setAttribute('aria-expanded', 'false');
        guideCard.setAttribute('hidden', '');
      });
    }

    // Town HUD Action Buttons
    const btnOpenPalette = document.getElementById('btn-open-palette');
    const burgerItemSearch = document.getElementById('burger-item-search');

    btnOpenPalette?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      sfx.select();
      window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('town:open-command-palette'));
    });

    burgerItemSearch?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      sfx.select();
      toggleBurger(false);
      window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent('town:open-command-palette'));
    });

    // Dev Tools Popover
    const btnToggleDevMenu = document.getElementById('btn-toggle-dev-menu');
    const townDevPopover = document.getElementById('town-dev-popover');

    btnToggleDevMenu?.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
      e.stopPropagation();
      const isHidden = townDevPopover?.classList.toggle('hidden');
      if (townDevPopover) {
        townDevPopover.style.display = isHidden ? 'none' : 'flex';
      }
      btnToggleDevMenu.classList.toggle('is-active', !isHidden);
    });

    document.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
      if (townDevPopover && !townDevPopover.classList.contains('hidden')) {
        const target = e.target as HTMLElement;
        if (!target.closest('.town-dev-wrap')) {
          townDevPopover.classList.add('hidden');
          townDevPopover.style.display = 'none';
          btnToggleDevMenu?.classList.remove('is-active');
        }
      }
    });

    const btnToggleXray = document.getElementById('btn-toggle-xray');
    const burgerItemXray = document.getElementById('burger-item-xray');
    const btnXrayClose = document.getElementById('btn-xray-close');
    const btnXraySave = document.getElementById('btn-xray-save');
    const btnXrayPurgeHidden = document.getElementById('btn-xray-purge-hidden');

    btnToggleXray?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      townDevPopover?.classList.add('hidden');
      if (townDevPopover) townDevPopover.style.display = 'none';
      btnToggleDevMenu?.classList.remove('is-active');
      engine?.toggleXray();
    });

    btnXrayPurgeHidden?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const count = townConfig.purgeAllHiddenBuildings();
      sfx.confirm();
      window.dispatchEvent(
        new CustomEvent('town:editor-toast', {
          detail: count > 0
            ? `🗑️ Berhasil menghapus permanen ${count} objek tersembunyi!`
            : 'ℹ️ Tidak ada objek tersembunyi yang tersisa di peta.',
        })
      );
      engine?.wake();
    });

    btnXrayClose?.addEventListener('click', () => {
      if (engine?.isXray()) {
        engine.toggleXray();
      }
    });

    btnXraySave?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      townConfig.saveToStorage();
      try {
        const res = await townConfig.saveToDisk();
        sfx.confirm();
        window.dispatchEvent(
          new CustomEvent('town:editor-toast', {
            detail: res?.success ? '💾 Perubahan peta berhasil disimpan ke disk!' : '💾 Disimpan ke memori browser (localStorage)!',
          })
        );
      } catch {
        sfx.confirm();
        window.dispatchEvent(
          new CustomEvent('town:editor-toast', {
            detail: '💾 Perubahan peta berhasil disimpan ke browser!',
          })
        );
      }
    });

    const toggleLabelsBtn = document.getElementById('btn-toggle-labels');
    const labelsContainer = document.querySelector('[data-town-labels]');
    const burgerItemLabels = document.getElementById('burger-item-labels');

    const toggleLabels = () => {
      if (!labelsContainer) return;
      const isHidden = labelsContainer.classList.toggle('town-labels--hidden');
      if (toggleLabelsBtn) {
        toggleLabelsBtn.classList.toggle('is-active', !isHidden);
        const iconSpan = toggleLabelsBtn.querySelector('.town-hud-btn__icon');
        if (iconSpan) iconSpan.textContent = isHidden ? '🙈' : '🏷️';
      }
      if (burgerItemLabels) {
        burgerItemLabels.classList.toggle('is-active', !isHidden);
      }
      sfx.select();
      showToast(isHidden ? '🏷️ Label landmark disembunyikan (Tekan L)' : '🏷️ Label landmark ditampilkan (Tekan L)');
    };

    toggleLabelsBtn?.addEventListener('click', toggleLabels);

    const recenterCamera = () => {
      engine?.recenterCamera();
      sfx.select();
      showToast('🎯 Kamera difokuskan ke karakter.');
    };

    const recenterBtn = document.getElementById('btn-recenter');
    recenterBtn?.addEventListener('click', recenterCamera);

    const zoomResetBtn = document.getElementById('town-zoom-reset');
    zoomResetBtn?.addEventListener('click', recenterCamera);

    const hudGuideBtn = document.getElementById('btn-hud-guide');
    if (hudGuideBtn && guideToggle) {
      hudGuideBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        guideToggle.click();
      });
    }

    // Fullscreen Controls (HUD & Town Editor)
    const btnToggleFullscreen = document.getElementById('btn-toggle-fullscreen');
